{"job_id":"F-2c2d5494edc244f5af4e","family_id":"F-2c2d5494edc244f5af4e","title":"미국 및 프랑스산 부틸글리콜에테르에 대한 덤핑방지관세 부과에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014316-244019-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":39,"target_id":"af71718ee9329a0eeb0ed43c71c8c7f979c8299a882fdd43bce41371542de8cb","source_hash":"cdc06b6aca393303f7b83b3aac6da1abea5db9f6e341c479d9bacb5934d63c7a","text":"关于对来自美国和法国的丁二醇醚征收反倾销税的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014316-244019-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":86,"target_id":"6f9974f3cec78e729c639aeb700a241d41c04c203b60ec94f49ef7cfe87997ee","source_hash":"1a2180cc6d0a23473176e09b095aee2b985442fe6d501f1561d90af9fc54684e","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《海关法》第五十一条指定应缴纳反倾销税的商品和供应商，并规定适用于该等商品的关税税率。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014316-244019-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":211,"target_id":"f1058a7ffc9095519dc2945dd7a26c2868ec7be28d74d091c17ae605846ed689","source_hash":"cdbee189caac950f21d4131559e90e704a2505605515f8d0ae9f75472a2dc6d5","text":"第二条（征税对象）对美国和法国的丁基乙二醇醚征收反倾销税（指根据《海关法实施令》第98条第1款规定，税则协调制度税号2909.43.0000对应的商品）。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014316-244019-ko","scope":"BODY","start":211,"end":286,"target_id":"977ba96c9d7481da2b7d88ce218aabf2f4780e509b47fa85fb43f5ec2817fb5c","source_hash":"2a9a883534d346b34789a4e35bdba50415b359f2b1157b2c69b6940aa7b3ebdb","text":"第三条（受征税货物的供应商和反倾销税税率）根据第二条规定受征税货物的供应商以及各供应商的反倾销税税率如下表所示。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014316-244019-ko","scope":"BODY","start":286,"end":308,"target_id":"b8b28c67fae1f137e16eac7aa64b850fbe51e84a2d2905a177b5bcd7d4987ef0","source_hash":"79fb6382a1a90f8dc40e12f6e2f091043dc1a4e1915ab7ed041f8275b93f700e","text":"补充规定 <第925号，2022年7月26日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014316-244019-ko","scope":"BODY","start":308,"end":338,"target_id":"a5f628c98d543c7f4021e9341431e14ddb11e0f9118f3b9a8952e41f256690c6","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71f36ac02